1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,459
A young diver with scuba gear swims through a vibrant coral
reef with tropical fish.

2
00:00:05,459 --> 00:00:10,500
She discovers a sunken pirate ship covered in seaweed and
treasure chests.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,589
A wise old sea turtle guides her back to the surface
through rays of sunlight.
